         &lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:24.000000000000004pt;text-align:justify;mso-pagination:none;mso-csssas11-rule:exactly;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none&quot; class=&quot;wza&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;2025年最后一天，冷空气、雨雪接连上线。气象监测显示，受冷空气影响，内蒙古、东北地区、华北北部气温继续下跌，31日早晨较30日早晨，内蒙古东北部、黑龙江西北部局地降温幅度达12℃以上。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
         &lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:24.000000000000004pt;text-align:justify;mso-pagination:none;mso-csssas11-rule:exactly;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none&quot; class=&quot;wza&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;中央气象台继续发布大风、寒潮、暴雪蓝色预警&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;预计未来三天，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;多股冷空气东移南下影响我国中东部地区，期间西北地区东部、黄淮西部、江淮及以南地区&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;日平均或最低气温将下降6～10℃，部分地区&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;降幅&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;可达10～12℃&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;1月3日早晨，最低&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;气温&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;0℃线将南压至&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;湖南中南部至福建南部一带&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;另外，东部和东南部海域有7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;～&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;8级风，阵风9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;～&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;10级。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
